How Air Flows Through a Vent — Exploded Teardown short (1080×1920, 74 s)

Made in code: no AI-generated video, no stock footage. The room, attic, blower, ducts and diffuser are a schematic model built in three.js (not to scale). Airflow particles are coloured by speed from typical published values (see FACTS.md); motion is compressed for visibility.
Facts and sources: FACTS.md.

